    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not just about being overwhelmed. i actually caused things to fall apart. i look at my sister and i see her life getting harder because i'm in it. i feel like if i just wasn't a factor anymore, they'd finally be able to breathe. like, they'd actually be happy for once.",
