      "content": "but taking space doesn't fix what i did. it just delays the inevitable. i keep thinking that if i was just gone, all this tension and all the problems i cause would just... stop. it feels like the only way to actually be unselfish and stop hurting them is to just not be a part of their lives anymore. does that even make sense?",
